  "details": "As much as I enjoy the updates of the game they are a lot of times useful. The most recent of updates are starting to kill off your users that have made this game popular I had 1,578 friends a year ago 125 online a day. Now 23 online every day I know this may seem off topic from updates but I have been with you guys for six years I have seen a lot but you guys are killing this game thousands of people I knew gave up but I stayed for a long time. I hoped it would have been fixed but it's dying faster now I have seen a friend I knew disappear in front of me because they got banned from your broken ai and now half of my friends refuse to play now that the limit is back to 10 mb for quest avatars and sounds for quest has been removed again. If you guys don't at least fix the sizes of avatars again you might have a dead game again I'm not threatening I'm only warning",
